Day 5: Dynamic Data Integration
Objective: Connect the Flask web server to AWS S3 to display live retail analytics.

🛠️ What was built
S3 Integration: Configured the Flask app using boto3 to fetch objects from a private S3 bucket.

Dynamic Routing: Updated the home route (/) to read, decode, and display data from test.txt instead of static text.

Network Security: Modified AWS Security Groups to allow inbound traffic on Port 5000.

Automated Logging: Implemented a crontab heartbeat script to log server health every 30 minutes.
